<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>You've been invited to Tellus</title>
  </head>
  <body style="font-family: -apple-system, Segoe UI, Helvetica, sans-serif; background: #f7f8fa; margin: 0; padding: 24px; color: #1c2127;">
    <div style="max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 32px;">
      <h1 style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 20px;">You've been invited to Tellus</h1>
      <p style="color: #4b5563; margin: 0 0 16px 0;">{{invitedBy}} created an account for you.</p>

      <p>Hi {{firstName}},</p>
      <p>
        Sign in with your email and the temporary password below. You will
        be asked to register a passkey before your session is created —
        the passkey replaces the temporary password as your day-to-day
        sign-in method.
      </p>

      <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: #f3f4f6; border-radius: 8px; margin: 16px 0;">
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 8px 12px; color: #6b7280; width: 150px;">Sign in at</td>
            <td style="padding: 8px 12px;"><a href="{{tellusOrigin}}/login">{{tellusOrigin}}/login</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 8px 12px; color: #6b7280;">Email</td>
            <td style="padding: 8px 12px;"><code>{{email}}</code></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 8px 12px; color: #6b7280;">Temporary password</td>
            <td style="padding: 8px 12px;"><code>{{temporaryPassword}}</code></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <p style="margin: 16px 0;"><b>Keep this email private</b> — it contains a working temporary password. Do not forward it.</p>
      <p style="margin: 16px 0;"><b>Not expecting this?</b> Contact {{invitedBy}} or your administrator before signing in; the account can be disabled before it is ever used.</p>

      <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; margin: 24px 0;">
      <p style="color: #9ca3af; font-size: 12px; margin: 0;">
        Tellus · {{tellusOrigin}}
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
